  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdace28a92ea39c1",
      "translationZh": "最近我发布了这套配置的一些基准测试结果，看起来很有潜力。于是，我开始用它运行 Qwen 3.8，但遇到了频繁崩溃的问题 :(",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "045ba4cc4b82774d",
      "translationZh": "我想继续使用 ROCm，因为对于较短的提示词，它的预处理速度（200-300 t/s）比 Vulkan（~60 t/s）高得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a96aa30e96983ee",
      "translationZh": "经过一番研究，并在 ChatGPT 的帮助下，我找到了这个相关问题：https://github.com/ROCm/legacy-rocm-build/issues/6512",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca8cb499622d5471",
      "translationZh": "以及临时解决办法：AMD_SERIALIZE_KERNEL=3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "133515d129cc9f87",
      "translationZh": "设置这个变量后，ROCm 运行稳定多了，但 pp 速度降到了 ~100 t/s，不过仍然比 Vulkan 快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5acfcc457a3cf2be",
      "translationZh": "有人试过在 Radeon 780m 或类似的集成显卡上使用 ROCm 7.14 吗？你们有同样的问题吗，也许有更好的解决办法？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6923233038e5d004",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/MaximusSenior 提交",
